<section class="legal-section">
    <h2 class="legal-h2">1. What this is</h2>
    <p class="legal-p">
        EggLedger exports Egg, Inc. spaceship mission history, including per-mission loot, to
        .xlsx and .csv, and lets you browse, filter, and chart that data. It ships in two forms:
    </p>
    <ul class="legal-list">
        <li>
            <strong>Desktop app.</strong> Windows, macOS, and Linux. Your mission data stays on
            your own machine.
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Web app.</strong> A hosted instance. Your mission data is decoded and stored
            on the server under your account.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <DesktopOnly>
        <p class="legal-p">You are running the desktop app, so the Desktop app section below applies to you.</p>
    </DesktopOnly>
    <WebOnly>
