<section class="legal-section">
    <h2 class="legal-h2">7. Web app and stored data</h2>
    <p class="legal-p">
        The hosted web app decodes your Egg, Inc. backup on the server and stores the result in its
        database under your account. That covers your mission history, drops, backups, settings,
        and reports. The data is kept until it is deleted.
    </p>
    <p class="legal-p">
